<title>FRANCE: Bouygues Offshore H1 revenues up 25.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Offshore H1 revenues up 25.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				  2,279  vs  1,815</p>
<p>     New Orders				2,569  vs  2,446</p>
<p>     Backlog				   3,570  vs  3,410</p>
<p>Three months to June 30 1997</p>
<p>     Turnover				  1,330  vs    900</p>
<p>NOTE - Bouygues Offshore S.A. -- an international contractor serving the oil and gas industry -- released the results in a statement. It said second quarter new orders increased substantially to 2,162 million francs compared to the 407 million in the first quarter, and this lifted the six-month backlog by 4.7 percent to 3,570 million francs. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
